@startuml
title E-Ticketing System State Transition Diagram

[*] --> UserType <<choice>>

state CreateUser
CreateUser : entry / start registration
CreateUser : do / submit registration details
CreateUser : exit / proceed to validation

state ValidateUser
ValidateUser : entry / validate user information
ValidateUser : do / check if valid
ValidateUser : exit / proceed accordingly

state LoginUser
LoginUser : entry / enter login credentials
LoginUser : do / authenticate user
LoginUser : exit / proceed to main menu

state MainMenu <<choice>>
MainMenu : entry / display options
MainMenu : do / wait for user choice
MainMenu : exit / transition based on selection

state CheckTicketStatus
CheckTicketStatus : entry / check ticket status
CheckTicketStatus : do / view current tickets
CheckTicketStatus : exit / return to main menu

state BookTicket
BookTicket : entry / select booking option
BookTicket : do / choose seats and destination
BookTicket : exit / proceed to payment confirmation

state ConfirmPayment
ConfirmPayment : entry / confirm payment details
ConfirmPayment : do / process payment
ConfirmPayment : exit / return to main menu

state ManageAccount <<choice>>
ManageAccount : entry / manage account settings
ManageAccount : do / edit or delete account
ManageAccount : exit / transition based on action

state Logout
Logout : entry / initiate logout
Logout : do
@enduml
